          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP687 Shilo’s Cap [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They say every dog has his day, and it’s nice to know that a select few also have a brass cap. Not an insta-find, but I eventually got it (unlike the one just to the north that stymied me today.) Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
